cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vFlow in your research, please cite the software using the metadata below and the Zenodo DOI for the exact version used."
title: "vFlow: Visual Flow Cytometry & Immunofluorescence Analysis Tool"
type: software
version: 4.4.3rc17
authors:
  - family-names: "Paget-Blanc"
    given-names: "Vincent"
abstract: >-
  vFlow is a desktop application for interactive 2D gating, visualization and
  quantification of flow-cytometry and single-particle immunofluorescence data
  from CSV, FCS and validated Gallios LMD list-mode files, with within-group
  statistical audits and nested replication analysis.
license: GPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/VincentPaget-Blanc/vFlow"
keywords:
  - flow cytometry
  - immunofluorescence
  - gating
  - FCS
  - single-particle analysis
  - synaptosomes
  - quantitative microscopy
  - Logicle
  - Gating-ML
  - Python
